<section class="founder" id="founder">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="founder-inner">
      <div class="founder-image-wrapper">
        {% if section.settings.image %}
          <img src="{{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 800 }}" alt="{{ section.settings.image.alt | default: 'Founder' }}" loading="lazy">
        {% else %}
          <p>Founder photo</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="founder-content">
        <div class="section-label">{{ section.settings.label }}</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">{{ section.settings.title }}</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">{{ section.settings.subtitle }}</p>
        <blockquote class="founder-quote">
          "{{ section.settings.quote }}"
        </blockquote>

        <!-- Expandable Full Story -->
        <button class="founder-story-toggle" onclick="toggleFounderStory(this)" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="founder-story-toggle-text">Read the Founder's Story</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="founder-full-story" id="founderFullStory">
          <div class="founder-full-story-inner">
            {{ section.settings.full_story }}
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="founder-name">{{ section.settings.founder_name }}</p>
        <p class="founder-title">{{ section.settings.founder_role }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Founder Story",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image",
      "label": "Founder Image"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "label",
      "label": "Section Label",
      "default": "The Discovery"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Section Title",
      "default": "A Note from the <span class='highlight'>Founder</span>"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "subtitle",
      "label": "Story Teaser",
      "default": "I didn't start NightForge because I wanted to sell a supplement. I started it because I was being lied to."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "quote",
      "label": "Quote",
      "default": "Night Forge is not just magnesium. It's 20+ years of business integrity, discipline, and relentless research forged into one uncompromising product — the one I needed when I was fading."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "full_story",
      "label": "Full Founder's Story",
      "default": "<p>At 43, I thought I had the ritual figured out. I've been a founder since I was 19, running a successful business for over two decades. I hit the gym six days a week. My diet was dialed. On paper, I was winning.</p><p>But inside, I was fading.</p><p>The fog crept in slow — sluggish mornings, mental haze, recovery that never felt complete. I went to the specialists. I assumed the fire was going out — low testosterone, aging, the usual excuses. The results came back: My blood work was perfect. My testosterone was higher than men half my age.</p><p>Physically, I was a 10. Mentally, I was disappearing.</p><p>The specialist handed me a bottle of Magnesium and charged me $68. I almost laughed — I already took Magnesium. I thought he was a quack. Until I took it.</p><p>Within days, the world snapped back into focus. I didn't just sleep — I recovered. The fog didn't just lift — it evaporated.</p><p>Then I ran out.</p><p>I went back to the \"high-quality\" brand I had been buying at the store here in Canada. Within a week, I crashed. Hard. That was the moment of clarity.</p><p>I realized that 99% of the Magnesium on the shelf is garbage. It's \"buffered\" with cheap Oxide and Citrate — fillers that do nothing but pass through your system and drain your wallet.</p><p>In Canada, getting the real thing — the pure, non-buffered trinity of L-Threonate, Bisglycinate, and Taurate — was nearly impossible without being extorted by specialty clinics.</p><p>I spent hundreds of hours in the rabbit hole. I studied the chemistry, the absorption rates, and the blood-brain barrier research. I decided that if the product I needed didn't exist for a fair price, I would build it myself.</p><p>Night Forge is that result. It's not a pill. It's 20 years of business integrity, 6 days a week of discipline, and hundreds of hours of research forged into a single ritual. It's the product I needed when I was fading. It's the product my wife and daughters needed when they were fading. It's the product you need to wake up resurrected.</p><p>No buffers. No fillers. No lies.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "founder_name",
      "label": "Founder Name",
      "default": "— AJ Vink"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "founder_role",
      "label": "Founder Title",
      "default": "Founder, Resurrect Nutrition Inc."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Founder Story"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
